<resources>
    <!-- ========================================
         DESIGN SYSTEM DOCUMENTATION
         ========================================
         
         CalcVault Theme System - Centralized Design Tokens
         
         THREE THEME VARIANTS:
         
         1. DARK THEME (Default/Secure)
            - Deep background (#0A0A0F)
            - High contrast for reading
            - Minimal glare
            - Primary accent: #4C8EFF (cool blue)
            - Use: Default for all vault screens
            
         2. WARM THEME (Emotional)
            - Soft background (#1A0A10)
            - Warm pink accent (#FF4466)
            - Romantic/comfortable feel
            - Use: When emotional content detected
            - Triggers: "i love you", "good night", etc.
            
         3. LIVE-SUBTLE THEME (Light Dynamic)
            - Light background (#F5F5F8)
            - Subtle accent (#3A73E0)
            - Professional / neutral feel
            - Use: Alternative for accessibility
            - No heavy animations, minimal motion
         
         ========================================
         SPACING SYSTEM (8dp Base Scale)
         ========================================
         
         xs   = 4dp    (smallest gap)
         sm   = 8dp    (base unit)
         md   = 12dp   (elements)
         lg   = 16dp   (padding)
         xl   = 20dp   (spacing)
         2xl  = 24dp   (larger spacing)
         3xl  = 32dp   (sections)
         4xl  = 40dp   (major sections)
         5xl  = 48dp   (screen edges)
         
         ========================================
         CORNER RADIUS (Consistency)
         ========================================
         
         sm   = 12dp   (small chips, inputs)
         md   = 18dp   (buttons)
         lg   = 24dp   (cards)
         xl   = 32dp   (panels)
         full = 999dp  (circles, pills)
         
         ========================================
         TYPOGRAPHY SCALE
         ========================================
         
         Display LG = 32sp (main titles)
         Display MD = 28sp (large titles)
         Display SM = 24sp (section headers)
         
         Headline LG = 28sp (headings)
         Headline MD = 24sp (subheadings)
         Headline SM = 20sp (labels)
         
         Title LG   = 22sp
         Title MD   = 18sp
         Title SM   = 16sp
         
         Body LG    = 18sp (calls-to-action)
         Body MD    = 16sp (primary text)
         Body SM    = 14sp (secondary text)
         
         Label LG   = 14sp
         Label MD   = 12sp (section labels)
         Label SM   = 11sp
         
         Caption    = 12sp (helper text)
         
         ========================================
         ELEVATION / SHADOW
         ========================================
         
         none = 0dp
         sm   = 2dp
         md   = 4dp   (cards, inputs)
         lg   = 8dp   (FABs, floating)
         xl   = 12dp  (modal panels)
         2xl  = 16dp  (highest emphasis)
         
         ========================================
         COLOR TOKENS
         ========================================
         
         PRIMARY SEMANTIC COLORS:
         - cv_accent          = Action color (accent)
         - cv_danger          = Destructive (red)
         - cv_success         = Positive (green)
         - cv_warning         = Cautionary (orange)
         
         TEXT HIERARCHY:
         - cv_text_primary    = Main text
         - cv_text_secondary  = Supporting text
         - cv_text_tertiary   = Subtle text
         - cv_text_quaternary = Disabled text
         
         SURFACE LAYERS:
         - cv_surface_overlay           = Light overlay
         - cv_surface_overlay_soft      = Very light overlay
         - cv_surface_overlay_strong    = Dark overlay
         - cv_surface_outline           = Dividers, borders
         - cv_surface_outline_strong    = Strong hints
         
         INPUT:
         - cv_input_surface             = Input background
         - cv_input_surface_focused     = Focused input BG
         
         ========================================
         COMPONENT STANDARDS
         ========================================
         
         BUTTONS:
         - Height: 48dp-64dp
         - Corner Radius: 18dp
         - Elevation: 4dp (active)
         - Padding: 12dp horizontal
         
         INPUT FIELDS:
         - Height: 60dp minimum
         - Padding: 16dp horizontal
         - Radius: 18dp
         - Background: cv_input_surface
         
         FABs:
         - Small: 48dp
         - Medium: 64dp
         - Large: 80dp
         - Elevation: 8dp
         
         CARDS:
         - Radius: 24dp (lg) or 32dp (xl)
         - Stroke: 1dp (thin)
         - Elevation: 0dp-4dp
         
         ========================================
         USAGE GUIDELINES
         ========================================
         
         1. NEVER use hardcoded colors
            - Always reference @color/* tokens
            
         2. NEVER inline text properties
            - Always use text style references
            - @style/TextBodyMedium, etc.
            
         3. NEVER hardcode dimensions
            - Use @dimen/* tokens for all sizes
            
         4. MAINTAIN consistency
            - Use the same spacing across screens
            - Button heights must be standardized
            - Icon sizes from cv_icon_* tokens
            
         5. THEME SWITCHING
            - All colors automatically update
            - Devices with "follow system" setting
            - Light/Dark/Warm selectable in settings
            
         6. PERFORMANCE
            - Minimal elevation (reduces overdraw)
            - No constant animations
            - Ripple effects only on interaction
            
         7. ACCESSIBILITY
            - Sufficient color contrast (WCAG AA)
            - Text sizes minimum 14sp
            - Touch targets minimum 48dp
         
         ========================================
         
         Version: 1.0 (April 15, 2026)
         Vault UI System - Final Polish
         
         ========================================
    -->

